---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';import courses from '../data/courses.json';
---
<Layout title="Practicals & activities"><div class="wrap"><PageHeader title="Learn by doing." description="The official practical tasks, organized by course. Use the preparation guide to plan your own work." kicker="PRACTICALS · SEMESTER 1" back="/practicals/" backLabel="Practicals"/><div class="source-note"><strong>Your own work matters.</strong><p>Follow your teacher’s assigned task and format. The reference structure below is a planning aid, not a completed submission or an official reporting format.</p></div><div class="reader-layout"><article>{courses.map(c=><section class="content-panel spaced" id={c.id}><span class="eyebrow">{c.code}</span><h2>{c.title}</h2>{c.practicum?<details><summary>Read the official practical tasks</summary><div class="source-text">{c.practicum}</div></details>:<><p>This course is organized around writing tasks, workshops and seminars. The choices and compulsory elements are specified in its units.</p><a href={`/courses/semester-1/${c.id}/`} class="text-link">Read the tasks in the official units →</a></>}<p class="small muted spaced">Source: SCERT Assam, 2024 curriculum, PDF pages {c.sourcePages.join('–')}. <a href={`/curriculum-2024.pdf#page=${c.sourcePages[0]}`}>Open original ↗</a></p></section>)}</article><aside><div class="content-panel sticky"><span class="badge">Reference structure</span><h3>Before you begin</h3><div class="checklist">{['Confirm the task and number of activities with your mentor.','Read the exact curriculum requirement.','Write an objective in your own words.','Plan materials, permissions and time.','Record what you actually observe or do.','Reflect on what worked and what you would change.','Add references and check the required submission format.'].map((s,i)=><label><input type="checkbox" data-check={`practical-${i}`}/><span>{s}</span></label>)}</div><a href="/templates/practical-planning.txt" download class="button secondary full">Download planning format ↓</a><button class="text-button spaced" data-print>Print this guide</button></div></aside></div></div></Layout>
